  packages/boring-bash/**                                   (Environment contract)
  docs/issues/1123/plan.md                                  (mount sets, exec grants, lease keying)
  plugins/ask-user/**                                       (approval surface)
  plugins/boring-governance/**
Note honestly where WE are weaker — especially on points 3, 4 and 5, which our governance model may not
actually address at all.

