330-### Message and delta events
331-```ts
332-{ type: 'message_start'; message: AgentMessage; turnId: string }
333-{ type: 'message_end'; message: AgentMessage; turnId: string }
334-{ type: 'text_delta'; text: string }
335-{ type: 'thinking_start'; contentIndex?: number }
336-{ type: 'thinking_delta'; contentIndex?: number; delta: string }
337-{ type: 'thinking_end'; contentIndex?: number; content: string }
338-{
339:  type: 'toolcall_delta';
340:  toolCallId: string;
341:  toolName: string;
342-  argumentTextDelta: string;
343-}
344-```
345:- `message_start` / `message_end` — bound every message the agent loop materializes: the user prompt, each assistant message (started with the partial message, ended with the final one), and each tool-result message. For assistant messages, `message_end` carries the authoritative completed message; deltas are best-effort live progress, and a subscriber registered mid-generation misses the deltas emitted before it attached.
346-- `text_delta` — a streamed fragment of assistant text.
347-- `thinking_start` / `thinking_delta` / `thinking_end` — bound one streamed reasoning block; `thinking_end.content` is the complete block. `contentIndex` is the zero-based index of the block within the assistant message's content array, when known; correlate thinking events within a turn by `contentIndex`.
348:- `toolcall_delta` — a streamed fragment of one tool call's JSON-arguments text, for live previews of in-flight calls. Emitted only once the streaming block knows its `toolCallId` and `toolName`. Live-preview only: never persisted, never replayed; the canonical record and the `tool_start` observation remain the source of truth for complete arguments.
349-Delta events carry no `turnId` payload field; correlate them through the envelope's `turnId` correlation field.
350:### `tool_start`, `tool`
351-```ts
352:{ type: 'tool_start'; toolName: string; toolCallId: string; args?: any }
353-{
354:  type: 'tool';
355:  toolName: string;
356:  toolCallId: string;
357-  isError: boolean;
358-  result?: unknown;
359-  durationMs: number;
